---
// 粒子网络背景组件（Canvas + 鼠标互动）
// 纯原生实现，无第三方依赖，自动适配深色/浅色模式
---

<div class="particle-bg" aria-hidden="true">
  <canvas id="particle-canvas"></canvas>
</div>

<script>
  // 粒子网络动画：光点 + 连线 + 鼠标吸引
  // 用 astro:page-load 确保 DOM 渲染完成后初始化（Astro 官方事件）
  // 容器尺寸未就绪时重试，最多 10 次
  let retryCount = 0;
  const MAX_RETRY = 10;
  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', () => {
    const canvas = document.getElementById('particle-canvas');
    if (!canvas) return;
    const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');

    // 性能与数量配置（移动端减少粒子数）
    const isMobile = window.matchMedia('(max-width: 768px)').matches;
    const PARTICLE_COUNT = isMobile ? 40 : 80;
    const MAX_DISTANCE = 150; // 连线最大距离
    const MOUSE_RADIUS = 180; // 鼠标影响半径

    // 粒子颜色（两种主题）
    const COLORS = {
      light: { particle: '79, 70, 229', line: '79, 70, 229' }, // indigo
      dark: { particle: '129, 140, 248', line: '129, 140, 248' }, // indigo-400
    };

    let particles = [];
    let mouse = { x: null, y: null };
    let width = 0, height = 0, dpr = 1;
    let theme = window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches
      ? 'dark'
      : 'light';
    let rafId = null;
    let fallbackTimer = null;

    function resize() {
      dpr = Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio || 1, 2);
      const parent = canvas.parentElement;
      width = parent.offsetWidth;
      height = parent.offsetHeight;
      if (width === 0 || height === 0) return; // 容器未就绪
      canvas.width = width * dpr;
      canvas.height = height * dpr;
      canvas.style.width = width + 'px';
      canvas.style.height = height + 'px';
      ctx.setTransform(dpr, 0, 0, dpr, 0, 0);
      initParticles();
    }

    function initParticles() {
      particles = Array.from({ length: PARTICLE_COUNT }, () => ({
        x: Math.random() * width,
        y: Math.random() * height,
        vx: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.5,
        vy: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.5,
        size: Math.random() * 2 + 0.5,
      }));
    }

    function draw() {
      if (width === 0 || height === 0) return;
      ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);
      const color = COLORS[theme];

      // 画粒子
      for (const p of particles) {
        ctx.beginPath();
        ctx.arc(p.x, p.y, p.size, 0, Math.PI * 2);
        ctx.fillStyle = `rgba(${color.particle}, 0.7)`;
        ctx.fill();

        // 移动
        p.x += p.vx;
        p.y += p.vy;

        // 边界反弹
        if (p.x < 0 || p.x > width) p.vx *= -1;
        if (p.y < 0 || p.y > height) p.vy *= -1;

        // 鼠标吸引
        if (mouse.x !== null) {
          const dx = mouse.x - p.x;
          const dy = mouse.y - p.y;
          const dist = Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy);
          if (dist < MOUSE_RADIUS) {
            const force = (MOUSE_RADIUS - dist) / MOUSE_RADIUS;
            p.x += (dx / dist) * force * 1.2;
            p.y += (dy / dist) * force * 1.2;
          }
        }
      }

      // 连线
      for (let i = 0; i < particles.length; i++) {
        for (let j = i + 1; j < particles.length; j++) {
          const a = particles[i];
          const b = particles[j];
          const dx = a.x - b.x;
          const dy = a.y - b.y;
          const dist = Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy);
          if (dist < MAX_DISTANCE) {
            const opacity = (1 - dist / MAX_DISTANCE) * 0.25;
            ctx.beginPath();
            ctx.moveTo(a.x, a.y);
            ctx.lineTo(b.x, b.y);
            ctx.strokeStyle = `rgba(${color.line}, ${opacity})`;
            ctx.lineWidth = 0.6;
            ctx.stroke();
          }
        }
      }
    }

    function onMouseMove(e) {
      const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();
      mouse.x = e.clientX - rect.left;
      mouse.y = e.clientY - rect.top;
    }

    function onMouseLeave() {
      mouse.x = null;
      mouse.y = null;
    }

    // 监听系统主题变化
    const themeQuery = window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)');
    themeQuery.addEventListener('change', (e) => {
      theme = e.matches ? 'dark' : 'light';
    });

    // 启动动画：rAF + setInterval 双保险
    let lastTime = 0;
    const FPS = 30;
    const loop = () => {
      draw();
      rafId = requestAnimationFrame(loop);
    };

    function start() {
      resize();
      if (width === 0 || height === 0) {
        // 容器未就绪，重试
        if (retryCount < MAX_RETRY) {
          retryCount++;
          setTimeout(start, 100);
        }
        return;
      }
      draw();
      try {
        rafId = requestAnimationFrame(loop);
      } catch {
        /* rAF 不可用时回退 */
      }
      fallbackTimer = setInterval(() => {
        const now = Date.now();
        if (now - lastTime > 1000 / FPS) {
          lastTime = now;
          draw();
        }
      }, 1000 / FPS);

      window.addEventListener('resize', resize);
      window.addEventListener('mousemove', onMouseMove);
      window.addEventListener('mouseleave', onMouseLeave);

      // 清理（Astro 页面切换时）
      document.addEventListener('astro:before-swap', () => {
        cancelAnimationFrame(rafId);
        if (fallbackTimer) clearInterval(fallbackTimer);
        window.removeEventListener('resize', resize);
        window.removeEventListener('mousemove', onMouseMove);
        window.removeEventListener('mouseleave', onMouseLeave);
      });
    }

    start();
  });
</script>

<style>
  .particle-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }
  .particle-bg canvas {
    display: block;
  }
</style>
